bring_me_mysterious_ore = text "Bring me [Mysterious Ore] and [Mysterious Gold Ore! Hurry and go mine it up!"
oh_you_actually_managed = text "Oh, you actually managed to find [Mysterious Ore] and [Mysterious Gold Ore]. Well, do you want me to purify it and turn it into an item?"
what_you_want_a = text "What? You want a Mattock? You took one before. I cannot just keep giving away Mattock for free, so I will give you a Mattock for 1 M Noah."
why_am_i_standing = text "Why am I standing here? Is it not obvious? I am standing here because I am a miner! Why is a miner standing here? So I can mine ores! You sure ask silly questions! Then why am I not mining any ores? It is bothersome, that is why, you smirk bastard! Actually, this is great. Go over there and start mining some ores for me. You do not know how to? Here, I will give you a Mattock, so hold this and press [Sparce Bar] near the ore veins. Then you will automatically start mining. Go on now! If you mine up some [Mysterious Ore], I will purify it and then craft it into a useful item for you! Run along now!"
